+- **MOTION_INTENSITY:** 4. Use short opacity/transform reveals, image hover scale on capable pointers, and feedback on explicit controls. No scroll hijacking or perpetual decorative loops.
+- **VISUAL_DENSITY:** 5. Show enough portfolio breadth to make the park legible, while keeping each listing's facts scannable.
+
+### First-viewport contract
+
+The landing viewport contains one eyebrow or category cue, one H1 of no more than two lines on desktop, a concise supporting statement, one primary viewing action and one secondary browse action, plus a real image surface with explicit provenance. The CTA remains visible without scrolling. A “wow” effect must communicate hierarchy, storytelling, feedback, or a state transition in one sentence.
+
+### 45-shop inventory contract
+
+The number 45 is a target, not evidence. Publish 45 units only after a verified register supplies stable identifiers, publishable status, facts, and an image mapping. The public inventory remains crawlable as a grid/list; a featured carousel may supplement it but never replace it. Do not repeat a contextual Pexels image and label it as a unique unit photo.
+
+### Content and market evidence
+
+Market copy is a claims register, not atmosphere. Every location or market claim needs a source, date, owner, confidence, and review date. First-party property facts, operator observations, and editorial guidance must be visibly distinguishable. Unknown rent, amenity, availability, access, or infrastructure values remain unknown.
+
+### Session design gate
+
+Before a broad UI/content edit, invoke the complete Eens audit set documented in `AGENTS.md`: `frontend-ui-engineering`, `design-taste-frontend`, `design-system`, `make-interfaces-feel-better`, `fixing-accessibility`, `fixing-motion-performance`, `fixing-metadata`, `anti-slop`, `brand`, and the verified AccessLint sequence `accessibility-audit` → approved `accessibility-fix` → `accessibility-diff` when available. `bencium-innovative-ux-designer` may implement an approved slice; `improve-ui` is a read-only audit/planning skill. The requested names `audit-and-fix` and `ui-improve` are not verified exact skills. Record evidence before editing in `docs/page-quality-audit-YYYY-MM-DD.md` or a focused design plan.
+
+### Motion and accessibility contract
+
+Animate only transform and opacity for continuous or repeated motion. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`, preserve 40px/44px control targets, keep visible focus, and provide keyboard equivalents for every carousel or expandable interaction. Use stable intrinsic image dimensions and avoid animation that changes layout, blurs large surfaces, or runs while off-screen.
+
+### Pre-flight additions
+
+- [ ] The “wow” is traceable to hierarchy, storytelling, feedback, or state transition.
+- [ ] The 45-unit count is backed by a verified register before publication.
+- [ ] Every published listing image has a unique source mapping or is clearly contextual.
+- [ ] Market claims have source/date/owner/review metadata.
+- [ ] Broad design/content sessions invoked the complete audit set and recorded evidence.
+- [ ] The session loaded `prompt-engineering` before emitting three Pass N+1 followups.
+- [ ] No PR or issue was merged or closed without exact-target per-operation approval and green verification.
